      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LAPRAS (7) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around this track over 410m in 23.43, claiming a Mix 6/7 by 0.8 lengths. Well placed and will be tough to beat. MONEY SCIENCE (2) hit the frame last time at this track but the start prior rocketed around 400m at Geelong in 22.53. Top win two back and rates a key player again. STARLORD BALE (3) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten 0.8 lengths (23.48) behind PAW LAPRAS at this track. Won at his only start from this box. Will give a great sight again. SAVE ME GARY (6) warrants respect although new to this track.",
